       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      * Driver: emulates JCL EXEC PGM=<prog>,PARM='...' for a program
      * whose PROCEDURE DIVISION takes the z/OS PARM block.
       PROGRAM-ID. LXZ036M.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-PROG   PIC X(8).
       01 WS-ARG    PIC X(100).
       01 PARM-BLOCK.
          05 PARM-LENGTH PIC S9(4) COMP.
          05 PARM-TEXT   PIC X(100).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT WS-PROG FROM ARGUMENT-VALUE
           ACCEPT WS-ARG  FROM ARGUMENT-VALUE
           MOVE WS-ARG TO PARM-TEXT
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ARG)) TO PARM-LENGTH
           CALL WS-PROG USING PARM-BLOCK
           STOP RUN RETURNING RETURN-CODE.
